  "$comment": "Youkai's Feasts' steamer: the pot (8 px, its water at 2..7) and up to eighteen racks over it, 4 px each (rack k from 8 + 4k), the lid on the top one. The station hides the tower's blocks while somebody works at it and draws them here; the code shows the racks the tower has, turns pot and lid as the blocks face, sets the four places of each rack where the steamer has them (its quarters of the block) and lifts the racks over the open one aside. place_K_P are the places, open_wall_N the open rack's walls (they stop the cursor), feast_K a feast block filling rack K, lift_N things going to the cook. Camera, badge and book as at the stockpot for an open rack with its top at 16 px; the code moves the camera and desk with the open rack.",
